  "question": {
    "text": "The expression given below shows the variation of velocity \\((v)\\) with time (t), \\(v=\\mathrm{At}^2+\\frac{\\mathrm{Bt}}{\\mathrm{C}+\\mathrm{t}}\\). The dimension of ABC is :",
